OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1785383018
OL,3,CMan who murdered two men in Cornwall
OL,4,Cgiven whole life order
OL,6,FWarning: Some readers may find the
OL,7,Fdetails in this report upsetting.
OL,9,FSerial killer James Desborough, 40,
OL,10,Fwho murdered Claudio Aquilino, 57, and
OL,11,FDaniel Coleman, 43, before
OL,12,Fdismembering and hiding their bodies
OL,13,Fin woodland in Cornwall last year has
OL,14,Fbeen handed a whole life order at
OL,15,FWinchester Crown Court.
OL,17,FDesborough was found guilty by a jury
OL,18,Fat Winchester Crown Court of killing
OL,19,Fthe two men.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
