PN,40105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1785383018
OL,3,CMan who murdered two men in Cornwall
OL,4,Cgiven whole life order
OL,6,F'Outstanding inquiries'
OL,8,FIn light of the deaths of Mr Aquilino
OL,9,Fand Mr Coleman, police are reviewing
OL,10,Fthe unexplained deaths of four others
OL,11,Fwho lived there at the same time as
OL,12,FDesborough.
OL,14,FThe killer lived at Sandy Lodge Hotel
OL,15,Fbetween December 2024 and April 2025,
OL,16,Fduring which time two men and two
OL,17,Fwomen died unexpectedly.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
