PN,40106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1785383018
OL,3,CMan who murdered two men in Cornwall
OL,4,Cgiven whole life order
OL,6,FDetective Superintendent Rachael
OL,7,FBentley, of Devon and Cornwall Police,
OL,8,Fsaid: "As a major crime investigation
OL,9,Fteam, we were informed by the
OL,10,Fcoroner's officer for His Majesty's
OL,11,FCoroner that there were four deaths at
OL,12,FSandy Lodge.
OL,14,F"As part of the investigation, a
OL,15,Fdetective inspector, separate to the
OL,16,Finvestigation but within major crime,
OL,17,Fdid a review of those deaths and that
OL,18,Fincluded commissioning some more
OL,19,Fforensic work, some CCTV and
OL,20,Fstatements.
OL,26,@pD@GOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,402,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1785383018
OL,3,CMan who murdered two men in Cornwall
OL,4,Cgiven whole life order
OL,6,F"There are still some inquiries
OL,7,Foutstanding on those.
OL,9,F"They remain as unexpected deaths, but
OL,10,Fthere are still some inquiries
OL,11,Foutstanding. He's not a suspect at
OL,12,Fthis time.
OL,14,F"We're in conversation with His
OL,15,FMajesty's Coroner, but they were
OL,16,Freviewed as part of the investigation."
OL,18,FShe added that the investigation into
OL,19,Fthe four deaths at the Sandy Lodge
OL,20,FHotel was "ongoing".
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@AOUvD@AOUxD@gO]|D@KOU|D@SO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
